{"reviewId": "260503178_8bEhiKOGR", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "\nA股设立初衷是帮国企脱困、给实体经济融资，融资功能长期放在第一位，投资者回报是次要的。美股是成熟的“股东回报市、机构定价市”；A股是转型中的“融资优先市、散户+政策共同影响的市场”，底层定位、交易规则、退市新陈代谢、投资者保护、投资者结构…几十年如一日没有长进", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "31598-31657", "abstract": "当市场成熟后，证券化率提高，资本市场的发展与实体经济的联系越来越紧密，伴随着工业化进程，资本市场的发展有一个很大的跳跃", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "260503178_8bEhiKOGR", "userVid": 260503178, "topics": [], "createTime": 1787746466, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 260503178, "name": "⛈️", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0029-vjTd9AJ5XNpIUl03jiW0a10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "⛈️", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "河伯见北海若", "medalInfo": {"id": "M4-0-100", "desc": "阅读书籍", "title": "阅读书籍", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 5, "likes": [{"userVid": 35426611, "name": "吕洪波", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTLDKv2x3MXWyeCOU4RpqwqpGegenqCQicjzHkuYX13aL05sBgsB4yQvbgpOdbxt65icTwBEvzaT0jicA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "吕洪波", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "拿散户当提款机用", "reviewId": "260503178_8bEhiKOGR", "comment